    "formats": "Existing installation identity and local-principal/v1 derivation use the fixed agent-capture-worker purpose. No new credential, durable actor file, object/wire schema, cursor/pending/prepared request, receipt or alias format. The additive NativeRequest publisher delegates to the same existing native service preparation and publication methods as RPC.",
