    "versions": "Rust 1.98.1; JJ 0.45.1; macOS ARM64; synthetic Codex CLI 0.156.1 source and real pinned Kingfisher transcript-paths/v1 sanitizer; actual native service/WAL/AgentStore reads and receipts over MemoryStore. Reopened admitted reader resumes offline completion after resolved queues; no fresh OS process, real RustFS, live model execution or full server lifecycle proof.",
