trols, unresolved pending-proof recovery, legacy absent AgentStore-root initialization, Cursor/OpenCode readers, Desktop/live harness and cold full-flow, UI and complete M17.3-M17.7 roadmap remain pending. Enabled startup guard remains. A concrete switched-spool pending-intent defect is fixed by binding source ownership to its original canonical/physical private root before progress reconstruction, at each step and around enqueue before ack; physical replacement at the same name also withholds. No browser lifecycle, native/WAL implementation, installed daemon, credentials, release or deployment changes; root aggregate and unrelated wider lanes are out of scope."
