    "versions": "Rust 1.98.1; JJ 0.45.1; macOS ARM64. Synthetic sanitized hook spool and direct native MemoryStore service consumers with the existing pinned Kingfisher cache. No real harness edit, whole-server cold restart or real-RustFS claim.",
