    "versions": "Rust 1.98.1; JJ 0.45.1; macOS ARM64. Four synthetic qualified Codex CLI 0.156.1 sessions, actual native service/WAL/AgentStore over MemoryStore, synthetic workspace/socket admission and pinned Kingfisher cache. Fresh test fixture and explicit supervisor shutdown/restart are distinct from cold whole-server/RustFS/live harness acceptance.",
    "formats": "No source/native admission/cursor/pending/prepared request/actor/receipt or public wire format changes. One-byte configured sanitized spool refusal; at most two exact raw source frames under one-reader supervision. Only sanitized progress/native eligibility can survive restart; paths/raw state remain opaque and memory-only. Stopped status excludes actually released reservations while draining status remains conservative.",
    "revision": "enclosing Jujutsu change yrrqpwvo",
    "scope": "Qualifies configured source-frame and spool-refusal pressure without evicting unacknowledged raw batches or enrolling excess sources. Revoking A while complete B contexts arrive cannot acknowledge or drop rejected batches. Paused immediate shutdown releases source ownership and now reports zero resident/occupied source reservations; outstanding draining owners retain their reservation counts. Explicitly recreating the supervisor with a larger configured capacity backfills only the two admitted native sessions, independently admits current B, safely omits old A and preserves original source identities. The other two historical starts remain withheld until the newly armed probes observe fresh starts, after which all four sessions sanitize/publish under B and the queue empties. The new exact pressure case found the stale shutdown counter regression after fixture defects were fixed; no assertions were weakened. Full direct supervisor binary is required by its shared status/lifecycle impact; unrelated capture-runtime/CLI/UI/whole-workspace/root aggregates are out of scope. M17/M17.2 remain In progress. Saturated durable queue pressure, source rotation/retirement/requalification, task-loss/deadline faults, process startup/ordered storage shutdown, legacy AgentStore initialization, remaining harness readers, typed authenticated controls, coverage/backlog UI and live harness/cold qualification remain pending. M17.3-M17.7 remain pending. No installed services/binaries, daemon restart, harness process, credential, checkpoint, deployment or publication changed; automatic startup remains guarded. Initial spec-first failure for the required CLI chapter was fixed by adding its canonical scope in this same change."
  },
