    "versions": "Rust 1.98.1; JJ 0.45.1; macOS ARM64. Synthetic qualified Codex CLI 0.156.1 transcripts, actual native MemoryStore service/WAL/AgentStore and synthetic workspace/socket admission. Private physical spool and pure local request envelope tests; direct existing local recovery and hook compatibility cases. No RustFS, live harness or whole-server cold qualification.",
    "formats": "PendingCaptureV1, reader cursors/metadata, native/local prepared requests, principal/request/publication/result/receipt identities and public wire schemas unchanged. Newly admitted automatic reader Captured files include trailing JSON whitespace sized to the larger native/local preparation bound. Older and independent writers already account for those physical bytes. Compact legacy and explicit hook records are unchanged; no new marker, version field, locks or silent configured capacity increase.",
