    "formats": "No persisted or wire format changes. Current-only AgentStore, source catalog/admission, source cursor, physical preparation reservation, exact native request/actor/receipt identities remain unchanged. Read-only strict current-binding inspection and memory-only compact retirement add no identity, lease, progress or publication capability.",
