    "versions": "Rust 1.98.1; JJ 0.45.1; macOS ARM64; synthetic Codex 0.156.1 CLI, directory/socket admission and actual native MemoryStore publication. In-process/fresh-process sanitization and CLI spool/native/local recovery fixtures. No live harness, RustFS or cold configured server qualification.",
    "formats": "Additive internal Rust CaptureCapacityRefusal type, server Error variant and CodexSupervisorStatus byte/count observations. Existing fixed error display preserved. No wire, persistence, dependency, source/admission/cursor or exact prepared request/actor/receipt format change. Physical JSON whitespace reservations and compact durable spool retries retain their supported profile independently of current-only AgentStore.",
    "revision": "enclosing Jujutsu change olokzsmk",
    "scope": "Retains exact body-free byte-limit refusal through shared admission/preparation, native source/pipeline recovery and supervisor delivery. Required total includes other pending physical bytes and reserved whitespace, excludes the replaced entry and authorizes no eviction, implicit increase or publication. Existing arbitrary corrupt/unsafe/read-limit failures keep their fixed generic validation errors and cannot fabricate this typed capacity diagnosis. Internal status has no filesystem work, counts last settled ingress refusals, reports their maximum and a separate last settled delivery requirement. Pause retains observations; completed successful/non-capacity steps replace them, and stopped/lost owners do not report active ingress pressure. Cached observations do not assert current pressure after another writer changes the queue. Exact regressions prove no rejected-capture cursor advancement, unchanged compact accepted bytes/cursor/native root before preparation fits, exact explicit relief, sanitized native recovery and clearing. The before failure is missing API compilation, not a behavioral test pass/fail. Shared spool capacity behavior across native and local consumers justifies complete capture-crate tests plus direct native/server/CLI publication/spool/recovery binaries; unrelated UI/model/whole-Rust-workspace/root aggregate and real-storage lanes are out of scope. All changed behavioral production modules remain below 300 lines. All previous 291 evidence entries preserved. M17/M17.2 remain In progress. Authenticated management/coverage UI, admitted multi-physical generation switching, wider rotation/root rebinding and task-loss/deadline faults, configured startup/ordered storage shutdown, Cursor/OpenCode readers and live/cold qualification remain pending; M17.3-M17.7 remain pending. Automatic enabled startup stays guarded and AgentStore stays current-only. No installed service/binary, unrelated daemon restart, credential, checkpoint, live harness, deployment or publication changed."
