    "formats": "Additive explicit RunningCodexCapture and bounded last-observed scalar snapshot. Internal watch command state is terminal after stop; no serialized control schema, raw persistence, cursor, pending, prepared request or receipt format changes. Current-only AgentStore remains supported.",
    "revision": "enclosing Jujutsu change ztzxnzpq",
