    "scope": "Foreground preparation previously owned external native-serving state locks separately from storage, so drop/run cancellation could release the lock while capture retained storage. Native preparation now transfers the original descriptor into storage before any capture lifetime; filesystem-only preparation retains its independent process lock. Late and duplicate attachment fail closed, preserving existing ownership and releasing rejected input. The large process module is extracted into owning preparation/authority/running modules below 300 lines without changing ordinary API/RPC/HTTP/search/replication behavior or the automatic enabled-startup guard. Shared process preparation and runtime/storage ownership affect native, filesystem, search and executable consumers, requiring complete owning library, configuration/embedded inventory, explicit capture runtime and cold CLI executable plus exact filesystem runtime acceptance, affected package checks and strict lint. This is the concrete escalation reason for wider direct lanes; root aggregates, unrelated UI/whole Rust workspace and real storage qualification remain out of scope. The full library lane ran before this entry was written; its escalation reason is shared lifecycle/storage infrastructure, also announced before remaining wider direct commands. Prior 296 entries are preserved. M17/M17.2 remain In progress: actual configured capture worker resource preparation/start/drain integration, broader fault/rotation/root-rebinding/discovery-delivery loss proofs, Cursor/OpenCode, typed authenticated controls/coverage UI, real RustFS/harness/cold full flow and M17.3-M17.7 remain pending. Only existing explicit native capture storage lifetimes are composed here; no configured worker is started, no source roots are scanned, no installed binaries/services/daemons, checkpoints, credentials, deployment or publication changed. Final owning/direct-consumer acceptance and all-target check/strict lint, Rust formatting, boundaries, architecture and canonical gates pass. The initial three-document style failure is retained and fixed. No configured capture worker is connected by this slice. Changed behavioral process modules remain at 119-247 lines. The exact foreground regression, four fresh-process cases, complete library, runtime/configuration and cold executable/filesystem direct consumers qualify retained process-lock ownership only; five real-storage/deployment ignores are not passes. No milestone completion is claimed."
